<title>USA: Mass. legislature approves flood relief bill.</title>
<headline>Mass. legislature approves flood relief bill.</headline>
<text>
<p>NEW YORK, Dec 13 (Reuter) The Massachusetts state legislature on Thursday approved a $7.5 million budget bill, which includes money for flood relief, and the measure is expected to help trigger additional federal disaster relief.</p>
<p>The amount of federal government aid was projected at $45 million. Gov William Weld has said he will sign the bill into law.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
